SUMMARY:🎃 Halloween Special: Meet New People | + 50+ Board Games | 21
 –45
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\n🎃 Looking for 
 a fun way to meet new people in Toronto this Halloween?\n\nYou could walk 
 into a room full of strangers and hope a conversation happens… or you co
 uld let us make the first step easy.\n\nJoin us for a Halloween Special at
  Stout Irish Pub\, where Fast Friends takes the guesswork out of making ne
 w connections.\n\nThrough relaxed\, professionally hosted conversations\, 
 rotations and Halloween-themed connection rounds\, you'll meet 20+ people\
 , discover common interests and have plenty of reasons to laugh and chat a
 long the way.\n\n🎃 Costumes are welcome but completely optional — com
 e dressed up\, add a little Halloween flair\, or simply come as you are.\n
 \nAnd the best part? The evening doesn't stop when the hosted rounds do.\n
 Afterwards\, stick around at Stout for 50+ board games\, drinks and more t
 ime to socialise with the people you've just met. 🎲🍻\n\nBook Early &
  Save: [https://toronto31stoct.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toronto31stoct.ev
 entbrite.co.uk)\nEarly Bird: CAD $10 \\| Regular: CAD $15 \\| Door: CAD $2
 0 cash\n\nAdvance tickets help us plan the right space and group size and 
 ensure a well-organised experience for everyone.\n\n🤝 What to Expect\n7
 :00 PM — Welcome & Drinks\nMeet your host\, Kruttika\, grab a drink and 
 settle in.\nComing alone? You're in good company. Many of our guests arriv
 e solo\, and our host will help you get comfortable\, make introductions a
 nd get the evening started.\n\n7:30–8:30 PM — Hosted Fast Friends\nThi
 s is where the evening really gets going.\nYou'll have a series of short\,
  guided conversations\, moving around the group so you get the chance to m
 eet a variety of people rather than spending the whole evening talking to 
 just one person.\nNo need to walk up to strangers and figure out what to s
 ay — we've created the structure for you.\n\n🎃 Halloween-Themed Conne
 ction Rounds\nAlongside the regular Fast Friends conversations\, we'll add
  some Halloween-inspired themed rounds with fun prompts and challenges des
 igned to get people laughing\, talking and discovering what they have in c
 ommon.\nExpect a few seasonal twists — nothing complicated\, just an eas
 y way to make the conversations even more fun.\n\n🎲 8:30 PM onwards —
  50+ Board Games & Socialising\nDon't feel like heading home after the hos
 ted rounds?\nStay and keep the evening going at Stout.\nWith 50+ board gam
 es available\, you can join a game with people you've met\, grab another d
 rink\, continue a conversation or simply mingle and see where the evening 
 takes you.\nYou don't need to be a serious gamer — the games are simply 
 another easy way to keep people interacting.\n\n🍻 And if you're staying
  later\, Stout's After Dark Special runs from 9–11 PM\, with $7 beers an
 d $7 highballs\, among other specials.\n\n❤️ Why This Event?\n✔️ H
 alloween Special 🎃\n✔️ Meet 25+ new people in one evening\n✔️ P
 rofessionally hosted conversations and rotations\n✔️ Halloween-themed 
 connection rounds\n✔️ Costumes welcome — but completely optional\n
 ✔️ 50+ board games at Stout 🎲\n✔️ Reserved area for our group\n
 ✔️ Easy-to-reach Toronto location\n✔️ Relaxed Irish-pub atmosphere
 \n✔️ Most guests attend solo\n✔️ Meet members from across our Toro
 nto social communities\n✔️ Ages 25–45\n✔️ Friendship-focused —
  not a dating event\n\n👥 Who Should Come?\nWhether you've recently move
 d to Toronto\, have lived here for years\, work from home and want a bigge
 r social circle\, or simply feel like meeting some different people — yo
 u're welcome.\nYou don't need to know anyone beforehand.\nCome by yourself
 \, bring a friend\, wear a costume or don't — the evening is designed to
  make it easy to get involved and start connecting.\n\n💳 Why Book in Ad
 vance?\nYour ticket helps us plan the right space\, manage the group size 
 and create a comfortable experience for everyone.\nOnline tickets are also
  cheaper than paying at the door.\n\n🌍 About Fast Friends\nFor over 10 
 years\, Fast Friends has been helping people make genuine connections thro
 ugh professionally hosted social events in 30+ cities around the world.\nO
 ur goal is simple: make meeting new people easier\, more relaxed and more 
 enjoyable.\nCome solo. We’ll guide the experience. You make the connecti
 ons. ❤️
