  to start isn't always easy.\n\n🤝 That's where Fast Friends comes in.\n
 \nJoin us at Stout Irish Pub for a professionally hosted social evening de
 signed to make meeting people feel natural and enjoyable. With guided conv
 ersations\, rotations and fun themed connection rounds\, you'll have an ea
 sy way to meet a variety of people\, discover shared interests and start b
 uilding new friendships — even if you arrive on your own.\n\nAnd the eve
 ning doesn't end with the hosted rounds! Stay for 50+ board games\, drinks
 \, food and Stout's After Dark Specials. 🎲🍻\n\n🎟️ Book Early & 
 Save: [https://toronto7thnov.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toronto7thnov.event
 brite.co.uk)\nYou can pay securely online with any debit or credit card th
 rough PayPal — no PayPal account required.\n\nAdvance tickets are cheape
 r and help us plan the right space and group size for a comfortable evenin
 g.\n\nEarly Bird: CAD $10 \\| Regular: CAD $15 \\| At the Door: CAD $20 ca
 sh\n\n🤝 The Evening\n7:00 PM — Welcome & Settle In\nMeet your host\, 
 Kruttika\, grab a drink and get comfortable.\nWhether you've recently move
 d to Toronto or have lived here for years\, it's a chance to step out\, me
 et some new faces and enjoy a different kind of Saturday evening.\nComing 
 alone? You're very welcome — many guests attend solo\, and our host will
  help you settle in and get connected.\n\n7:30–8:30 PM — Hosted Fast F
 riends\nMeeting people doesn't have to mean approaching a room full of str
 angers and hoping a conversation takes off.\nOur host guides you through s
 hort conversations and rotations\, so you can meet a variety of people thr
 oughout the evening. You don't have to worry about who to approach or what
  to say next — the structure makes it easier to get involved and discove
 r who you connect with.\n✨ Themed Connection Rounds\nWe'll add interacti
 ve prompts and themed conversation challenges to help you discover shared 
 interests\, swap stories and find unexpected common ground.\nFrom travel a
 nd food to music\, hobbies and weekend adventures\, these rounds help move
  conversations beyond the usual small talk.\n\n🎲 8:30 PM onwards — 50
 + Board Games & Socialising\nWhy end the evening just as you're getting to
  know people?\nStout has more than 50 board games available\, giving you a
 n easy way to keep socialising after the hosted rounds. Join a game\, meet
  others around the table\, share a few laughs\, grab another drink or simp
 ly continue a conversation.\nYou don't need to be a board-game expert. It'
 s all about having fun together and giving new connections more time to gr
 ow.\n\n🍻 Stay for Stout's After Dark Specials\nIf you're planning to st
 ay later\, Stout's After Dark Special runs from 9–11 PM\, with $7 beers 
 and $7 highballs\, among other specials.\nIt's a great way to extend your 
 evening\, relax with the people you've met and enjoy more of Stout's livel
 y pub atmosphere.\n\n❤️ Why Come Along?\n✔️ Meet 20+ new people in
  one evening\n✔️ Professionally hosted conversations and rotations\n
 ✔️ Interactive themed rounds to spark better conversations\n✔️ 50+
  board games at Stout 🎲\n✔️ Stout's After Dark Specials from 9–11
  PM 🍻\n✔️ Reserved space for our group\n✔️ Relaxed Irish pub at
 mosphere\n✔️ An opportunity to meet members from across our Toronto Me
 etup communities\n✔️ Solo attendees welcome\n✔️ Designed for ladie
 s and gents aged 25–45\n✔️ Friendship-focused — not a dating event
 \n\n📍 Why Stout Irish Pub?\nLocated at 221 Carlton Street\, Stout offer
 s a relaxed\, welcoming pub atmosphere with food\, drinks and an impressiv
 e selection of more than 50 board games.\nIt's a great setting for an even
 ing that starts with hosted conversations and continues with board games\,
  laughter and more time to get to know the people you've met.\n\n👥 Who 
 Is It For?\nYou don't need to be new to Toronto\, belong to an existing gr
 oup or know anyone attending.\nWhether you're looking to build a social ci
 rcle\, meet people beyond work\, make friends after moving to the city or 
 simply enjoy a different kind of Saturday night\, you're welcome.\nCome by
  yourself or bring a friend. We'll help make the introductions easier.\n\n
 🌍 About Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has been bringin
 g people together through professionally hosted social events in 30+ citie
 s worldwide.\nOur goal is simple: make meeting new people easier\, more re
 laxed and more enjoyable.\n\nCome for the conversations. Stay for the boar
 d games. Leave with new connections. ❤️\nCome solo. We'll guide the ex
 perience. You make the connections. 🤝
